<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>I'm Not Made by Design</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Nothing But Thieves</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Broken Machine (Deluxe)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">263jAWjIxXBdHuh8xlFMLY</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.400" end="00:10.920">I live on oxygen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.920" end="00:13.110">a bastard monkey boy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.110" end="00:21.110">Do what the hell I like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.420" end="00:40.920">I'm no celestial toy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.840" end="00:44.070">Your goddess is bathed in gold</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.070" end="00:50.310">while keeping us in line</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.310" end="00:58.310">We're killing each other</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.260" end="01:05.760">for a woman in the sky</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.770" end="01:06.270">Ooooooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.830" end="01:09.120">I'm not made</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.120" end="01:10.620">I'm not made by design</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.570" end="01:11.070">Ooooooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.660" end="01:11.160">Can you be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.020" end="01:11.520">Can you be satisfied</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.590" end="01:12.090">Ooooooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.650" end="01:18.650">I'm not made</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.140" end="01:20.640">I'm not made by design</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.590" end="01:21.090">Ooooooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.650" end="01:21.150">Can you be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.400" end="01:28.400">Can you be satisfied</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.990" end="01:35.790">This kiss in the parking</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.790" end="01:43.790">lot is turning me to stone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.240" end="01:49.050">You take the sweetest thing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.050" end="01:57.050">then claim it as your own</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.650" end="02:00.150">Ooooooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.710" end="02:03.510">I'm not made</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.510" end="02:05.010">I'm not made by design</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.960" end="02:05.460">Ooooooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.020" end="02:05.520">Can you be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.230" end="02:05.730">Can you be satisfied</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.130" end="02:06.630">Ooooooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.190" end="02:13.190">I'm not made</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.430" end="02:15.930">I'm not made by design</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.880" end="02:16.380">Ooooooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.940" end="02:16.440">Can you be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.150" end="02:16.650">Can you be satisfied</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.840" end="02:23.840">You take the sweetest thing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:54.480" end="03:02.480">and claim it as your own</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.540" end="03:11.040">Ooooooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:09.600" end="03:14.430">I'm not made</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.430" end="03:15.930">I'm not made by design</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.880" end="03:16.380">Ooooooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:14.940" end="03:16.440">Can you be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:15.150" end="03:16.650">Can you be satisfied</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.050" end="03:17.550">Ooooooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.110" end="03:24.110">I'm not made</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:24.930" end="03:26.430">I'm not made by design</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:25.380" end="03:26.880">Ooooooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:25.440" end="03:26.940">Can you be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:25.860" end="03:29.860">Can you be satisfied</p></div></body></tt>